    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "（それに、もっとスイーツを楽しみたかった。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 56,
    "dress": "old-cowgirl",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-cowgirl_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "（西部劇っぽさを表現しながら味もなかなかよろしい『西部』のスイーツ……♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 56,
    "dress": "old-cowgirl",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-cowgirl_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "（もっと食べたかった、せめて時間ぎりぎりまで堪能したかった！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "（ここで処刑されたら、もう食べられないのかなぁ？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "（撃たれて死んだら、＄はぜんぶ没収されるって聞いたことある。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "（せっかく、『賞金首』とか倒しまくって稼いだのに～？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "（うう、スイーツ制覇の夢がご破算だ……！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 56,
    "dress": "old-cowgirl",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-cowgirl_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "（あぁ……だめだ、どれだけ寝てたんだろ。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "（たしか次のスイーツ店を目指して歩いてるうちに、お腹がすいて行き倒れちゃったんだっけ？）"
